msgid "Gaps mark periods without samples. The sample time is when this page read the hardware, not a heartbeat from the fan guard, and a running guard process does not prove that fan protection is working. This page does not change the kernel thermal curve, the 77 PWM floor or the full-speed fault latch."
msgstr "空白表示该时段没有样本。采样时间是本页读取硬件的时间，不是风扇保护进程的心跳；保护进程存在也不代表风扇保护有效。本页不改变内核温控曲线、77 PWM 下限或故障满速锁定。"

msgid "Not collected; avoids a full hardware table scan"
msgstr "未采集，以避免扫描完整硬件表"

msgid "Active counts and resource use are current state; software event counters accumulate until reset. A loaded module, an enabled setting or a successful read does not show that traffic is accelerated, and flow counts are not throughput."
msgstr "活动数量和资源占用是当前状态，软件事件计数在重置前累计。模块已加载、设置已开启或读取成功均不表示流量已被加速；流数不是吞吐量。"

