msgid "Advisory only: compares the configured band and primary channel with the frequency list the driver reports for the matching phy. Channel width, country, DFS/CAC and transmit legality are not checked, nothing is changed, and radio startup is not blocked. Configured state does not confirm whether a radio is transmitting."
msgstr "仅作提示：将配置的频段和主信道与驱动为对应 PHY 报告的频率列表比较。不检查信道带宽、国家/地区、DFS/CAC 或发射合法性，不修改任何配置，也不阻止无线启动。配置状态不能确认无线正在发射。"

