msgstr "显示"

msgid "At most %d targets"
msgstr "最多 %d 个目标"

msgid "Use a unicast %s address (not loopback, link-local or multicast)"
msgstr "请使用单播 %s 地址（不可为回环、链路本地或组播地址）"

msgid "Whole number without leading zeros"
msgstr "不带前导零的整数"

msgid "Shows ICMP echo reachability from the chosen egress to the configured target addresses on the front network LEDs (white and amber). It does not test DNS, web pages or proxies: networks that filter ICMP can show unreachable while other traffic works, and a lit white LED does not prove that DNS, web or proxy traffic works. System status, RGB, Ethernet port and SFP LEDs are not touched."
msgstr "用机身 network 指示灯（白色、琥珀色）显示所选出口到配置目标地址的 ICMP echo 可达性。不检测 DNS、网页或代理：过滤 ICMP 的网络可能显示不可达而其他流量正常；白灯亮起也不代表 DNS、网页或代理可用。不改变系统状态灯、RGB、网口灯和 SFP 灯。"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Off by default. While enabled the service drives the white:network and amber:network LEDs unless a System → LED Configuration entry names them. Stopping turns both off again (board default)."
msgstr "默认关闭。启用后，服务控制 white:network 和 amber:network 指示灯；若“系统 → LED 配置”已设置某灯，则不接管该灯。停止后两灯恢复熄灭（板级默认）。"

msgid "Check %s"
msgstr "检测 %s"

msgid "With both families enabled, one reachable family shows as partial (white blinking)."
msgstr "两个协议族都启用时，仅一个可达显示为部分可达（白灯闪烁）。"

msgid "%s targets"
msgstr "%s 目标"

msgid "1 to %d addresses. The family counts as reachable when any of them answers; one failing target alone does not mark the egress down. Defaults are public anycast DNS resolvers (AliDNS, DNSPod) and can be replaced."
msgstr "1 至 %d 个地址。任一地址响应即判定该协议族可达；单个目标失败不会判定出口失联。默认值为公共任播 DNS 解析器（阿里 DNS、DNSPod），可替换。"

msgid "%s egress"
msgstr "%s 出口"

msgid "\"auto\" follows the kernel route to each target (works with the LAN DHCP bypass, where the default route is on lan). A named interface pins the probe to its device; if that interface is missing or down the family shows \"interface unavailable\", and without a route through it \"no applicable route\"."
msgstr "“auto”按内核到各目标的路由选择出口（适用于 LAN DHCP 旁路，默认路由位于 lan）。指定接口时探测绑定到该接口设备；接口不存在或未启动显示“接口不可用”，经该接口无路由则显示“无适用路由”。"

msgid "auto (default route)"
msgstr "auto（默认路由）"

msgid "Interval (s)"
msgstr "间隔（秒）"

msgid "Seconds between rounds, 10 to 3600."
msgstr "两轮探测之间的秒数，10 至 3600。"

msgid "Reply timeout (s)"
msgstr "响应超时（秒）"

msgid "Wait per echo, 1 to 5 s. Each command also has a hard time bound."
msgstr "每次 echo 等待 1 至 5 秒；每条命令另有强制时限。"

msgid "Failure confirmation (rounds)"
msgstr "失败确认（轮）"

msgid "Consecutive failed rounds before a family is shown unreachable, 1 to 10. The same number of rounds where the probes cannot run turns a result into stale."
msgstr "连续失败多少轮后显示不可达，1 至 10。连续相同轮数无法执行探测时，结果转为过时。"

msgid "Recovery confirmation (rounds)"
msgstr "恢复确认（轮）"

msgid "Consecutive successful rounds before an unreachable family is shown reachable again, 1 to 10."
msgstr "不可达后需连续成功多少轮才恢复显示可达，1 至 10。"

msgid "Current state"
msgstr "当前状态"

msgid "LED meaning"
msgstr "灯态含义"

msgid "White steady: every enabled family reaches a target."
msgstr "白灯常亮：所有已启用协议族均可到达目标。"

msgid "White blinking: some enabled families reach a target, others do not or are not confirmed."
msgstr "白灯闪烁：部分已启用协议族可到达目标，其余不可达或未确认。"

msgid "Amber steady: no enabled family reaches a target (unreachable, no route, or interface unavailable)."
msgstr "琥珀灯常亮：已启用协议族均无法到达目标（不可达、无路由或接口不可用）。"

msgid "Amber blinking: not determined yet, or the probes keep failing to run (stale)."
