msgstr "软件满速锁定"

msgid "Set"
msgstr "已设置"

msgid "first reason"
msgstr "首次原因"

msgid "Not set"
msgstr "未设置"

msgid "The guard record is written by the fan guard itself after each protection step. Publishing is best effort and can lag or be skipped, so it is shown as current only for the one running guard instance and only within 10 s; otherwise it is the last record and the current guard state is unknown. The sample age is when the guard last checked the sensors. A set latch is the guard's software decision to hold full speed until it restarts; it does not prove that the PWM write succeeded or that the fan is running at full speed, and passing checks do not replace hardware acceptance."
msgstr "守护记录由风扇守护进程在每次保护步骤后自行写入。发布为尽力而为，可能滞后或被跳过，因此仅当记录属于唯一运行中的守护实例且在 10 秒内更新时才显示为当前；否则仅为上次记录，当前守护状态未知。采样时长指距守护进程上次检查传感器的时间。锁定为守护进程在重启前保持满速的软件决定，不证明 PWM 写入成功或风扇实际满速运行；检查通过也不能替代硬件验收。"
